       "target": "qf[3][3]",
       "value": "16",
       "delay": 0.8
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "So: bigger memory changes only the tag. Bigger blocks trade index bits for offset bits. More ways trade index bits for tag bits. And for a fixed cache and address, the tag depends only on the associativity."
